"color:rgb(167,29,93);font-family:Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:pre\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:pre\">[D] restrictedMatrix;</span></div></div></blockquote></div>"
